rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/6a2ae9b4f193d.jpg"> </div><p>日本国家队官方宣布，球队中场远藤航因伤退出世界杯名单，补召效力于德甲门兴的前锋町野修斗。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2afb9a748d1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">远藤航自宣：我决定借着无缘本次世界杯，正式从日本国家队退役</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2afa30ee9a2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：阿根廷国家队补召塞内西参加世界杯，顶替巴列尔迪</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/6a2afad80e798.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/6a2afad80e798.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/6a2afad80e798.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷国家队官方宣布，补召后卫塞内西参加世界杯，顶替此前因伤退出的巴列尔迪。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2b0dc81d8f8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梦想成真！塞内西度假时接到电话获阿根廷征召，与女友激动拥抱</a></p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a26d9c0ec58anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">狂人归来！官方：穆里尼奥出任皇马主帅，时隔13年重返伯纳乌！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605162303045583.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605162303045583.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260516/202605162303045583.jpg"> </div><p>皇马官方宣布，63岁的穆里尼奥担任皇马主教练。穆里尼奥和皇马签约三年，葡萄牙人时隔13年再度执教皇马！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2afc901d908native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">说到做到！老佛爷许诺1.5亿巨星+穆帅均官宣，还剩科纳特邓弗里斯</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2b2d4926e38native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：B席将加盟皇马，两年合同+一年续约选择权</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120549439709_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120549439709_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120549439709_720.jpg"> </div><p>直播吧06月12日讯 罗马诺以标志性的“Here we go”宣布，皇马免签31岁B席，双方达成两年合同+一年续约选择权。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2b0211e7651native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">迅速变卦！阿斯：B席一得知皇马可能性后 马上暂停与巴萨马竞谈判</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2ae3adbf8b9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：纽卡4000万欧报价穆尼奥斯，皇马有球员50%所有权</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260419/69e48b060e9b6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260419/69e48b060e9b6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260419/69e48b060e9b6.jpg"> </div><p>阿斯报报道，纽卡斯尔接近签下奥萨苏纳边锋穆尼奥斯，皇马将获一半转会费。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2af4f087867native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：帕斯告知皇马希望留队科莫，过去12小时留队希望显著上升</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260120/696ea5da8256f_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260120/696ea5da8256f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260120/696ea5da8256f.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺消息，尼科·帕斯已直接告知皇家马德里，他更希望下赛季留队科莫。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2b0d48c2a29native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">国际足联公开员工收入：因凡蒂诺2025年收入480万美元</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.c